    {
      "finding": "The TabCNN framewise representation is showing diminishing returns under decoder/objective-only changes.",
      "evidence": "V2->V3 produced a large temporal cleanup; V3->V4 recovered recall but traded back precision/fragmentation, while frozen macro F1 remains only 0.2435.",
      "implication": "V5 should test a representation/architecture change with explicit onset/activity and string-identity modeling rather than another scalar threshold adjustment."
    }
